                  },
                  "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Constant name could be clearer**\n\n`MAX_ATTEMPTS` could be `MAX_CI_FIX_ATTEMPTS` to make clear it only counts CI fixes.",
